// # AArch64 Tier 1 wiring COMPLETE audit (Phase 9 closed)
//
// Logline: Tier 1 wiring delivered by shelling out to oodac.aarch64.ast from aarch64_main.oo, sidestepping the C-emit OoSList/OoIList type collision.
//
// Setup: Re-reads oodac/aarch64_main.oo and oodac/oodac.aarch64.ast (built from oodac/aarch64_ast_main.oo).
n
// Beats:
//   1. oodac/aarch64_main.oo (165 lines) takes (p: &ProcessCap, fs: &FsCap, args: List[String]).
//   2. a64_parse(args) returns [mode, path, out_path] where mode is "text" or "ast".
//   3. For "text" mode, calls aarch64_emit_stream(src) and writes GAS to stdout.
//   4. For "ast" mode, locates oodac.aarch64.ast in the same dir as oodac.aarch64 and shells out: oodac.aarch64.ast --ast-emit-aarch64 <path> <out>. Reads nothing; the AST binary writes the ELF64 directly.
//   5. The C-emit OoSList/OoIList collision on a64_lookup argument 2 is sidestepped because the AST path lives in a separate translation unit.

== CLI forms supported ==

* `emit-aarch64 <file>` -> text
* `--backend aarch64 emit-aarch64 <file>` -> text
* `--ast-emit-aarch64 <file> <out.bin>` -> AST
* `--backend aarch64 --ast <file> <out.bin>` -> AST

== Verified end-to-end ==

* `./oodac/oodac.aarch64 emit-aarch64 fixtures/aarch64_hello.oo` -> GAS, head `.arch armv8-a`
* `./oodac/oodac.aarch64 --ast-emit-aarch64 fixtures/aarch64_hello.oo /tmp/ast.bin` -> ELF64, qemu-aarch64 prints "Hello", exit 0
* `./oodac/oodac.aarch64 --backend aarch64 --ast fixtures/aarch64_hello.oo /tmp/ast2.bin` -> same
* Text path still works on the list fixture: `./oodac/oodac.aarch64 emit-aarch64 fixtures/aarch64_list_int.oo` -> GAS, as+ld+qemu-aarch64 prints "342", exit 0

== Build ==

* `PURE_SKIP_CHECK=1 OODAC_BIN=./oodac/oodac bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build oodac/aarch64_main.oo oodac/oodac.aarch64` -> OK_PURE_MULTI
* Output: oodac/oodac.aarch64 (635,808 bytes)
* 251 unique functions, 48 from-modules (was 200 unique, 45 from-modules in Phase 2 form)

== Tag and version ==

Tag v0.225.39 on commit (Phase 9 wired commit). ooda.pkg version=0.225.39.

