* Phase 2: v0.225.32 List[T] port (proven on qemu-aarch64)
* Phase 3: v0.225.33 shape_refuse gate + no_output runtime
* Phase 5: v0.225.34 AST-path runtime smoke (binary proven)
* Phase 6: v0.225.35 AAPCS64 multi-function-call (proven on qemu-aarch64)
* Phase 7: v0.225.36 cross-architecture equivalence (aarch64 proven, x86 has separate regression)
* Phase 8: v0.225.37 pattern matching fixtures (Some/None and Ok/Err 2-arm proven)
* Phase 9: v0.225.39 Tier 1 wiring (single oodac.aarch64 with both text and AST paths, proven end-to-end)
